conclusion:
Full Semantic E2E remains the integration spine. It observes the closed Supplier Payment / Shipment Release Review WOW v1.1 summary as bounded context/evidence. The closed mock ActionCommitPacket and closed receipt are observed only. SemanticEvidenceClaim remains candidate-only. Root alone creates FinalOutput. No new packet, receipt, mock payment, real connector, provider call, network call, secret access, real payment, shipment release, or real-world effect is introduced by this alignment.

